==Battleground==
*1 [[Pinky Bear]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

